IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Sei proprio tu?
{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Come stai, carissim{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Sei qui {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}} per turismo?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Peccato... Io lascio la città
